  mapping_en={'optimized version/':'Current 512 KB / 1 MB CAR/ROM, 512 KB XEX and version information.','original/':'Original ROM for rebuilding and comparisons.','dist/':'IPS patches for both sizes and checksums.','src/':'Sources and generators; latest in src/v13, earlier internal stages support rebuilding.','scripts/':'Build, benchmark, statistics, chart and XEX test tools.','results/':'Measurement and validation data; latest series in results/v13.','docs/':'Changes, methodology and research; concise ILMENIT_IDEAS summary.','analysis/':'Reverse engineering of the original.','arc/up38/':'Solo/Opus archive, with its historical XEX level-end defect.'}
